.DS_Store

# VCF/BAM content is verified separately (VCFs via each test's own
# vcf_records/sv_records checks; BAMs by existence only) since both formats
# embed run-specific header metadata (command lines, timestamps, temp paths)
# that make a whole-file hash non-reproducible across otherwise identical
# runs. .tbi/.csi indices pair with a .vcf.gz body and shift their own byte
# layout whenever that body's header size changes, so they're not
# independently meaningful to content-check either.
**/*.vcf.gz
**/*.vcf
**/*.vcf.gz.tbi
**/*.vcf.gz.csi
**/*.bam
**/*.bam.bai

# fastp/fastqc per-lane reports and every MultiQC data file derived from them
# embed a generation timestamp and/or are threshold-triggered (e.g.
# overrepresented-sequences, duplication-levels) on this dataset's low read
# counts, so both their content and, in some cases, their very existence can
# vary between identical runs. Existence is still covered by each test's own
# stable_path ignore list where that additionally applies.
**/*.fastp.html
**/*.fastp.log
**/*_fastqc.{html,zip}
multiqc/multiqc_data/fastp*.txt
multiqc/multiqc_data/fastqc*.txt
multiqc/multiqc_data/fastqc-status-check-heatmap.txt
multiqc/multiqc_data/multiqc_fastp.txt
multiqc/multiqc_data/multiqc_fastqc.txt
multiqc/multiqc_data/multiqc_general_stats.txt

# Picard metrics files embed a "# Started on:"-style run timestamp header;
# vcf2cytosure's .cgh and VEP's HTML stats summary embed a run date too.
**/*multiplemetrics*
**/*wgsmetrics*
**/*hsmetrics*
**/*_sorted_md.metrics.txt
**/*.cgh
**/*_summary.html

multiqc/multiqc_data/multiqc.parquet
multiqc/multiqc_data/multiqc.log
multiqc/multiqc_data/multiqc_data.json
multiqc/multiqc_data/multiqc_sources.txt
multiqc/multiqc_data/multiqc_software_versions.txt
multiqc/multiqc_data/llms-full.txt
multiqc/multiqc_plots/{svg,pdf,png}/*.{svg,pdf,png}
multiqc/multiqc_report.html
pipeline_info/*.{html,json,txt,yml}
